    "problem": "If $D=\\{(x,y)\\hspace{0.167em}:\\hspace{0.167em}(x-3)^{2}+{y}^{2}\\le 9\\}$, then $$\n\\displaystyle ∬_(D)(x^{2} - y^{2})dA =\n$$",
